  "notes": "Fish facing right. Body ellipse centre (27,20), rx 11, ry 7, bottom at y 27. Tail left (x 11-16, forked). Eye (34,18). Start (14,20.5) facing up. Split: Chloe = top edge from tail join (16,20) over (27,13), restanding near (18,20), then carrying on over the back; Dev = back (27,13) to nose (38,20); Ben = bottom from tail join (16.5,21.5) down to (22.5,27), now extending to (27,27), then up to (37.5,23.5), round to nose; Ava = tail, lower arm joined into Ben's start at 3:00, upper prong bridging onto Chloe's first domino at (16.7,20.2) at 4:30. Pad gone; working from memory. Next: confirm the (27,27) extend stands, then curve up to the nose. Check the Ava/Chloe bridge near (16.5,20) and whether Chloe's restand at (18,20) is up."
}

